  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following reactions\n$\\mathrm{K}_2 \\mathrm{Cr}_2 \\mathrm{O}_7 \\xrightarrow[-\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}]{\\mathrm{KOH}}[\\mathrm{A}] \\xrightarrow[-\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}]{\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4}[\\mathrm{~B}]+\\mathrm{K}_2 \\mathrm{SO}_4$\nThe products $[A]$ and $[B]$, respectively are :",
